asset:        StarWipe.wgsl
title:        GL Transitions "StarWipe" transition shader, hand-ported to WGSL
author:       Ben Lucas (upstream GLSL); FilmCraft contributors (WGSL port and Rust reference)
source:       https://github.com/gl-transitions/gl-transitions/blob/master/transitions/StarWipe.glsl
license:      MIT
license-file: crates/render/src/transitions/shader/LICENSE-gl-transitions.txt
added:        2026-10-17 by FilmCraft contributors (C1, lane T)
notes:        Hand port of the upstream GLSL to WGSL, keeping its Author/License header; the upstream header says License: MIT. The FilmCraft host (prelude.wgsl, original work) supplies the bindings, progress (eased on the CPU), getFromColor/getToColor (clamped bilinear, linear premultiplied colour, uv origin bottom left) and GLSL helpers. The Rust reference of the same function is in cpu.rs. Changes from upstream: star_center comes from FilmCraft's Center point (sequence pixels to uv); atan2 at the exact centre pinned to 0.
